{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/891710-i-need-moar","id":891710,"title":"I need moar!","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Werewolf: The Forsaken"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-05-16T07:07:44-07:00","id":891710,"title":"I need moar!","content":"Seriously, The Pack is way too short for all the awesome it has shoved into it. I can't get enough of Lodges. So this is me requesting from the fans their Lodge ideas. I'd love to see what everyone has cooking.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/717-monghani","name":"Monghani","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar717_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"358"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-16T07:14:13-07:00","id":891713,"title":"","content":"Don't have The Pack yet, but one idea I've been entertaining is The Lodge of the Broken Gear, a group of Uratha and Wolf-Blooded who have gathered to purge the G-M from existence in general and the Shadow in particular.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3514-zealouschristian24","name":"ZealousChristian24","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1796"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-16T07:18:48-07:00","id":891715,"title":"","content":"Good intentions besides, some fan-updates just won't cut it for me. We could really use some lodge books.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","u